<http://data.silknow.org/object/8bbcbae1-c458-3491-ab16-0f9c96703407/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Textile of silk with a green satin ground, brocaded in shades of pink, yellow, cream, dark green and blue silk and metal thread. It is trimmed with a lace-pattern and a dense repeating pattern of semi-naturalistic flowers and leaves. Central part of the design has large-scale flowers and leaves in group one above the other. On either side is a vertical reversed repeat with an undulating curve of a lace-type grid pattern and flowers and leaves of different dimensions."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8bbcbae1-c458-3491-ab16-0f9c96703407> .

